# Append to your existing .gitignore when adding the infra addon.

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Kubernetes
**/secrets.yaml
**/*.kubeconfig

# CloudFormation
**/cfn-temp/

# Pulumi
Pulumi.*.yaml
**/.pulumi/

# Generic infra secrets
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
